<title>JAPAN: Saikaya - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Saikaya - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    33.95		vs	   34.33</p>
<p> Operating	  437    mln	  vs	  361    mln</p>
